# This repository is content-addressed: retained oracle evidence pins the
# SHA-256 of implementation and test SOURCE FILES, not just of generated
# artifacts. Git's default autocrlf would rewrite LF to CRLF on Windows
# checkout, changing those bytes and breaking every source-bound evidence
# assertion. Normalize to LF everywhere so a file's hash is the same on every
# platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixture and evidence payloads are compared byte-for-byte; never transform them.
*.memh   binary
*.bin    binary
*.cf32le binary
*.cf64le binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.icns   binary
*.ico    binary
